<title>BRAZIL: Brazil's Cesp 1996 loss higher.</title>
<headline>Brazil's Cesp 1996 loss higher.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil state controlled power utility Companhia Energetica de Sao Paulo (Cesp) issued the following statement on its 1996 results according to the Corporate Law accounting method.</p>
<p>			 1996	     1995</p>
<p>    shr loss	    5.48 reais     2.07 reais</p>
<p>    loss		  513.9 million	193.6 million</p>
<p>    net oprtnl revs   2.3 bln	  1.8 bln</p>
<p>Note: All data above in Brazilian reais. Share profit figures provided per 1,000 shares.</p>
</text>
